easures can catch up.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>France: Student protests over conditions at French high schools fuel political clashes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5516e15bff84b3a17778d36a505f881726da30573345b6fd856ca5d5d31deb3b</id><updated>2026-09-29T05:54:23Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T02:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/france-student-protests-over-conditions-at-french-high-schools-fuel-political-clashes/a-79467746--66d7071b54d7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/france-student-protests-over-conditions-at-french-high-schools-fuel-political-clashes/a-79467746?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Over 160 people were arrested and dozens injured after student protests in France descended into violence. With a presidential election approaching, senior politicians are pointing fingers at each other.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Israel's Netanyahu holds secret meeting with UAE president</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3332c1ace4b2609d504413ee7fbdb8da971a09ec3e773c7dd8bcc6da50b9066b</id><updated>2026-09-29T05:54:26Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T01:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/israel-s-netanyahu-holds-secret-meeting-with-uae-president/a-79467271--ad566d17ce40.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/israel-s-netanyahu-holds-secret-meeting-with-uae-president/a-79467271?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After confirming a rare meeting, Netanyahu's office has denied suggestions that the Israeli prime minister requested that Abu Dhabi deny reports that it had warned Israel about an impending Hamas attack in 2023.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US sanctions on Iran's aviation industry make travel less predictable as countries cancel flights</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:975a1ec3d3ccefc30e2a0b65f71ab4536049d12