-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">French bishops took "courageous" steps when faced with "the painful scourge of abuse of minors," Pope Leo XIV told the high-ranking clerics before his scheduled meeting with survivors at the Catholic shrine of Lourdes.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Diesel prices are surging putting further pressure on Europe</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e2b096911bd761853139668a5ffe381e2d12cf0a2d3625634a15be8c6a1cb41e</id><updated>2026-09-29T05:53:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-28T10:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/diesel-prices-are-surging-putting-further-pressure-on-europe/a-79390992--edb37306aa00.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/diesel-prices-are-surging-putting-further-pressure-on-europe/a-79390992?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Trucks, farms and industry are powered with diesel. Now prices are soaring due to refinery disruptions, supply shortages and geopolitical tensions. A potential US export ban could make Europe's diesel crunch even worse.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Will Jürgen Klopp's charisma be enough for Germany?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0b16fb4a582215832d54d3430767c727822a943fed02abf525d311480b049177</id><updated>2026-09-29T05:53:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-28T09:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/will-j_rgen-klopp-s-charisma-be-enough-for-germany/a-79455266--fed309f9f1f4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/will-jürgen-klopp-s-charisma-be-enough-for-germany/a-79455266?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After defeat to Greece, Jürgen Klopp is confronted with the real challenge of his task as Germany head coach. Can his charisma alone push this group forward?</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Ireland beat Israel 3-0 in Nations League match overshadowed by political controversy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a262d79d3f4ec5c59263ee678dc2ddbe7ff3e2640d810a27d1efdb2393719ef3</id><updated>2026-09-29T05:53:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-28T09:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ireland-beat-israel-3-0-in-nations-league-match-overshadowed-by-political-controversy/a-79455254--ac737f0c12b9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ireland-beat-israel-3-0-in-nations-league-match-overshadowed-by-political-controversy/a-79455254?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ireland easily beat Israel in a Nations League fixture that 24 hours earlier appeared in doubt. One Irish player pulled out of the match to express his opposition to Israel's actions in the Gaza Strip.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Sweden faces political deadlock after election-winning center-left bloc fails to form government</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:09a586c187deb5c3327aba8ab4defef6d307a42524a74fd0da97f4154a8984a6</id><updated>2026-09-29T05:53:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-28T09:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/sweden-faces-political-deadlock-after-election-winning-center-left-bloc-fails-to-form-government/a-79455295--58807b74d479.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/sweden-faces-political-deadlock-after-election-winning-center-left-bloc-fails-to-form-government/a-79455295?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Swedish Social Democratic Party leader Magdalena Andersson has abandoned efforts to form a four-party government. Deep divisions within the election-winning bloc have left Sweden in political deadlock.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India: LPU suspends classes after violent protests over alleged campus rape</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:360c97332c0961f572be55364cc031650552f57c987015e10782e70687e105b9</id><updated>2026-09-29